# digithings — Cursor legacy rules

Canonical rules for this repo live in AGENTS.md. Read that file and follow it.
This file is a pointer, not a second copy. Do not add stack-wide rules here.

Cursor Agent loads .cursor/rules/digithings.mdc (alwaysApply: true).
Regenerate that adapter with: make agents-init

CLAUDE.md is the Claude Code loader. It points at AGENTS.md too.
opencode.json and .mcp.json are tool configuration (model provider and MCP servers).
They are not rule copies. Do not paste AGENTS.md into them.

Workflow: docs/agents/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md
